# Example overlay for machine-local terms.
# Shared terminology lives in scripts/dictation/vocabulary.txt (committed).
# Copy this file to ~/.config/whisper-dictation/vocabulary.txt only for extras
# that should not be in git.
#
# Format:
#   term
#   term / alias
#   canonical => spoken form / mishearing
#
# Aliases: db / database
# Replacements: os_droid => OS underscore droid / oesteroid
